{"3894750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Sword Wizard - Part 1", "steam_appid": 3894750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Sword Wizard – Part 1</i> is a 2D action-adventure game through a fun and silly story with lots of swords. Magically combine swords for various attacks and upgrades like raining swords down from the sky. Inspired by <i>The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past</i> and <i>Magicka</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Gray, a young magician, on his journey to become the Sword Wizard. He will face an incredible danger that threatens all existence. But... he's not ready for that yet. He's still a kid, inexperienced and weak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part 1 takes Gray through four chapters of his childhood.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with surly classmates and difficult instructors at the Magical Academy of Magic.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contend with emotionally fragile crime lords and warlords.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be swept up in a war and protect the army's cell phones so their morale won't plummet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accidentally trespass the domain of a weird fish king.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there will be many villagers who need saving since they can't be bothered to defend themselves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fight his opponents, Gray chooses to use an unusual type of magic: Swords!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch swords</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack with four different types of swords for different uses and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/0c78e1f3af7a2da618fdc74263e2cab9.avif?t=1787024400\" width=190 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/ede519871ceafa94a06f50ab6d02241f.avif?t=1787024400\" width=190 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/c78792b08f0d3583a156acabee689159.avif?t=1787024400\" width=190 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/601922955b12c4ef0574dda06e7456eb.avif?t=1787024400\" width=190 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/be63b41da6687ec70a15c74fdc30bc0a.apng?t=1787024400\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/be63b41da6687ec70a15c74fdc30bc0a.poster.avif?t=1787024400\" class=\"bb_img\" width=234 height=88 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your swords by combining them together into new forms like the Tissue Disruptor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/f2abb32411e9f6d2d3fba6cd045a04a1.avif?t=1787024400\" width=176 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to wield  swords in other ways besides launching, such as spinning them around, raining them down from the sky, or creating this monstrosity:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/de7ff354da1ee4fe2ff7c3dafad7f266.avif?t=1787024400\" width=460 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore numerous maps of 2D pixel art to find more swords, spot random items other game heroes seem to care a lot about, and maybe discover some wood elves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/08eb5762d84b18214dc927fe0d6b544a.avif?t=1787024400\" width=248 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight numerous strange creatures and enemies who want to attack you (often for no particular reason).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/c6514ff55f5ba2cbd6ecebd244045de3.avif?t=1787024400\" width=600 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to all sorts of  even stranger people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894750/extras/04fd59f747b651f0207584e88b2e5f16.avif?t=1787024400\" width=600 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Sword Wizard – Part 1</i> is a 2D action-adventure game through a fun and silly story with lots of swords. Magically combine swords for various attacks and upgrades like raining swords down from the sky. Inspired by <i>The Legend of Zelda: A Link to the Past</i> and <i>Magicka</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_pa